  "description": "Find the length of the longest consecutive elements sequence in an unsorted array.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. let set = new Set(nums)\n2. let maxLen = 0\n3. for (let num of nums) {\n4.   if (!set.has(num - 1)) {\n5.     let curr = num, currLen = 1\n6.     while (set.has(curr + 1)) {\n7.       curr++, currLen++\n8.     }\n9.     maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, currLen)\n10.  }\n11. }",
